    "response": "**Associate Degree Programs**\n\n* **College of Eastern Idaho** (Idaho Falls) - Associate of Science in Fire Science\n* **College of Southern Idaho** (Twin Falls) - Associate of Applied Science in Fire Science\n* **North Idaho College** (Coeur d'Alene) - Associate of Applied Science in Fire Science\n\n**Bachelor's Degree Programs**\n\n* **Eastern Washington University** (Spokane, WA) - Bachelor of Science in Fire Science\n* **Idaho State University** (Pocatello) - Bachelor of Science in Emergency Management and Disaster Preparedness with an Emphasis in Fire Science\n\n**Online Programs**\n\n* **North Dakota State University** (Fargo, ND) - Online Bachelor of Science in Fire and Emergency Services Management\n\n**Fire Training Academies**\n\n* **Idaho Department of Lands** (Boise) - Basic Wildland Firefighter Type 2 Certification\n* **Idaho Fire Service Training Academy** (Boise) - Firefighter I and II certification\n* **North Idaho College Fire Science Academy** (Coeur d'Alene) - Firefighter I and II certification\n\n**Additional Resources**\n\n* [Idaho State Fire Marshal's Office](https://firemarshal.idaho.gov/)\n* [Idaho Fire Chiefs Association](https://idahochiefs.org/)\n* [National Wildfire Coordinating Group](https://www.nwcg.gov/publications/procurement)",
